    <mxCell id="n210" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13.5px;color:#0B0B0B&quot;&gt;The three cuts do not coincide: the starting count removes K = 1 … K = 10, the size floor closes the chain at K = 20, and the skip bar needs K ≈ 31, which the floor never reaches. The Yes branch is offered K = 11 → K = 20 with no count at break-even.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1146.0" width="1840.0" height="30.0" as="geometry" />
